""";

    private static readonly string SampleSpec = """
# 📐 Technical Specification: Client-Side Engine

## 1. Overview
This system provides high-performance, zero-latency browser computation using compiled **WebAssembly** binaries.

### Architectural Goals
1. Maintain total user data privacy.
2. Eliminate backend server processing costs.
3. Support offline execution via Web Workers.

---

## 2. API Data Flow

```json
{
  "status": 200,
  "engine": "Blazor WebAssembly .NET 10",
  "features": ["OpenXML Parsing", "PDF Rendering", "GFM Markdown"]
}
```
""";

    private static readonly string SampleRelease = """
# 📦 Release Notes — v2.0.0

### 🎉 New Features
- Added **Markdown (.md) Visualizer** with live GFM parsing and export capabilities.
- Added **Word to PDF Converter** using client-side OpenXML processing.
- Introduced full **Light & Dark Mode** design system.

### 🐛 Bug Fixes
- Improved mobile navigation drawer responsiveness.
- Fixed scrollbar color consistency in dark mode.
""";
}
